<title>CHINA: China Jan-May sugar imports slump 42.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-May sugar imports slump 42.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>China imported 210,000 tonnes</p>
<p>of sugar in the first five months of this year, down by 42.9</p>
<p>percent from the same 1996 period, customs figures showed on</p>
<p>Tuesday.</p>
<p>	  IMPORTS JAN-MAY     MAY	YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGE</p>
<p> Sugar    210,000	    80,000	 -42.9</p>
<p>	  EXPORTS JAN-MAY     MAY	YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGE</p>
<p> Sugar    92,103	     29,385	 -73.3</p>
<p>Note: figures in tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532-1921</p>
</text>
